   "doc": "Q3 TU",
   "fy": "FY21",
   "g": "CUT",
   "s": -2,
   "q": "On-track to deliver at the low end of full year guidance, reflecting impact of Delta variant and supply constraints",
   "file": "20211104_SN_Trading-Statement.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-02-22",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -1,
   "q": "Our guidance assumes some ongoing impact from COVID, with Omicron a headwind in Q1 and the hospital staffing shortages likely to continue throughout the year.",
   "file": "20220222_SN_Final-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-04-28",
   "doc": "Q1 TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Our first quarter trading results put us on track to meet our full year guidance for 2022, which is unchanged.",
   "file": "20220428_SN_Trading-Statement.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-07-28",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "CUT",
   "s": -3,
   "q": "In terms of trading profit margin, we now expect the trading profit margin to be around 17.5%, reflecting prolonged impact of the inflationary environment and continued external supply challenges.",
   "file": "20220728_SN_Half-year-Report.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-11-03",
   "doc": "Q3 TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "We delivered 4.8% underlying revenue growth in the third quarter, with all franchises and geographies contributing, and are on track to deliver our full year guidance.",
   "file": "20221103_SN_3rd-Quarter-2022-Trading-Report.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-02-21",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "For trading profit margin, we expect to deliver at least 17.5% as the positive operating leverage from revenue growth, productivity improvements and the early benefits of our cost saving initiatives more than offset continuing macroeconomic headwinds from raw material cost inflation, higher wages and a 100bps headwind from transactional foreign exchange.",
   "file": "20230221_SN_Final-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-04-26",
   "doc": "Q1 TU",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Full year guidance for 2023 is unchanged, with targets of 5.0% to 6.0% underlying revenue growth (around 5.0% to 6.0% reported based on exchange rates on 20 April 2023) and a trading profit margin of at least 17.5%.",
   "file": "20230426_SN_Q1-2023-Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-08-03",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "RAISE",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Following our strong first half revenue growth, we are upgrading our underlying revenue growth target for the full year to be in the range of 6.0% to 7.0% (previously 5.0% to 6.0%).",
   "file": "20230803_SN_Half-year-Report.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-11-02",
   "doc": "Q3 TU",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "CUT",
   "s": -2,
   "q": "We now expect trading profit margin to be around 17.5% for the full year. As previously guided, trading profit margin in the second half is expected to be considerably stronger than the first half.",
   "file": "20231102_SN_3rd-Quarter-2023-Trading-Report.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-02-27",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "2024 guidance: underlying revenue growth expected in the range of 5.0% to 6.0% (4.6% to 5.6% reported), and trading profit margin expected to be at least 18.0%",
   "file": "20240227_SN_Final-Results.md"
